{"pages":[{"segs":[["C YC L E S O F C A M P U S M O M E N T U M 1",43.841199999999994,509.49989999999997,57.071200000000005,649.17939999999999,9,false],["CYCLES OF CAMPUS",151.90000000000001,33.840599999999995,507.90000000000009,116.00059999999996,80,false],["MOMENTUM",151.90000000000001,93.840599999999995,376.05999999999995,176.00059999999996,80,false],["ERIC SWANSON",151.90000000000001,167.78059999999994,298.60000000000002,194.10059999999999,20,false],["as possible and getting them into group studies.",370.20299999999997,225.43089999999984,549.36599999999999,237.83289999999988,9,false],["During the First Quarter, students are generally more",370.20299999999997,251.43189999999981,572.23500000000013,263.83389999999986,9,false],["open to talking about spiritual things or taking a",370.20299999999997,264.42789999999979,551.87700000000007,276.82989999999984,9,false],["survey. All Quarters are not equal in this regard. If you",370.20299999999997,277.42389999999989,574.02600000000007,289.82589999999988,9,false],["had as your goal to initiate with 1,000 students per",370.20299999999997,290.41989999999987,560.50800000000004,302.82189999999986,9,false],["staff this year, most likely you would not try to reach",370.20299999999997,303.41589999999985,567.03300000000013,315.81789999999984,9,false],["250 per Quarter. A good 40% of the yearly initiative",370.20299999999997,316.41189999999983,563.85600000000022,328.81389999999982,9,false],["and evangelism takes place during the first Quarter.",370.20299999999997,329.40789999999981,564.99900000000002,341.8098999999998,9,false],["Hence, you need to plan accordingly. This is why",370.20299999999997,342.40389999999979,553.29899999999998,354.80589999999978,9,false],["mid-year evaluations can be deceptive. At the time it",370.20299999999997,355.39989999999977,568.74300000000005,367.80189999999976,9,false],["appears that you are well over half-way in reaching",370.20299999999997,368.39589999999976,562.54200000000014,380.79789999999974,9,false],["your numerical goals. When the truth of the matter",370.20299999999997,381.39189999999974,562.92900000000009,393.79389999999972,9,false],["is the majority of your evangelism has already been",370.20299999999997,394.38789999999972,563.34300000000007,406.7898999999997,9,false],["done.",370.20299999999997,407.3838999999997,390.94799999999998,419.78589999999969,9,false],["Whether your campus utilizes the traditional two",146.40000000000001,355.43489999999997,333.74400000000009,367.83689999999996,9,false],["Semester terms or three Quarter terms, an invaluable",146.40000000000001,368.43089999999995,348.86400000000003,380.83289999999994,9,false],["way of looking at your school year is to divide it into",146.40000000000001,381.42689999999993,341.42100000000016,393.82889999999992,9,false],["four quadrants that reflect the natural flow of the",146.40000000000001,394.42289999999991,331.548,406.8248999999999,9,false],["school year. The First Quarter begins a week or so",146.40000000000001,407.41889999999989,334.30200000000002,419.82089999999988,9,false],["before school begins and ends at the Fall Conference.",146.40000000000001,420.41489999999988,346.803,432.81689999999986,9,false],["The Second Quarter begins after the Fall Conference",146.40000000000001,433.41089999999986,346.42500000000007,445.81289999999984,9,false],["and terminates with the Christmas Conference.",146.40000000000001,446.40689999999984,327.46199999999999,458.80889999999982,9,false],["The Third Quarter begins when school resumes in",146.40000000000001,459.40289999999982,336.74099999999999,471.8048999999998,9,false],["January and concludes at Spring Break. The final",146.40000000000001,472.3988999999998,332.19600000000003,484.80089999999979,9,false],["Quarter starts after Spring Break and finishes with",146.40000000000001,485.39489999999978,338.68500000000006,497.79689999999977,9,false],["the completion of the school year.",146.40000000000001,498.39089999999976,273.50700000000006,510.79289999999975,9,false],["Although the First Quarter has proven to be an",370.20299999999997,433.38489999999967,546.423,445.78689999999966,9,false],["effective time for evangelism, you may want to",370.20299999999997,446.38089999999966,545.33400000000006,458.78289999999964,9,false],["consider the merits of focusing on the Christians on",370.20299999999997,459.37689999999964,566.70900000000006,471.77889999999962,9,false],["campus during the First Quarter. The University of",370.20299999999997,472.37289999999962,563.39700000000005,484.7748999999996,9,false],["Missouri calls this their “Christian Rush.” They amass",370.20299999999997,485.3688999999996,575.98800000000006,497.77089999999959,9,false],["their labor force for the rest of the school year during",370.20299999999997,498.36489999999958,570.12900000000013,510.76689999999957,9,false],["this First Quarter. Since few other Christian groups",370.20299999999997,511.36089999999956,565.75500000000011,523.76289999999949,9,false],["are doing evangelism they wait until the Second",370.20299999999997,524.35689999999954,551.05799999999999,536.75889999999958,9,false],["Quarter before really having an evangelistic emphasis.",370.20299999999997,537.35289999999952,575.673,549.75489999999957,9,false],["CYCLES OF MOMENTUM",146.40000000000001,530.81989999999996,252.70000000000002,551.35989999999993,20,false],["Within each Quarter there is a natural “cycle of",146.40000000000001,550.43489999999997,324.91500000000008,562.83690000000001,9,false],["momentum.” That is to say, each Quarter begins",146.40000000000001,563.43090000000007,327.38100000000009,575.8329,9,false],["with some type of evangelistic outreach, involves",146.40000000000001,576.42689999999993,331.84499999999997,588.82889999999998,9,false],["a time of consolidation and momentum, and then",146.40000000000001,589.42290000000003,332.41200000000009,601.82490000000007,9,false],["concludes with an opportunity to raise the level of",146.40000000000001,602.41890000000001,335.52600000000001,614.82090000000005,9,false],["commitment and involvement of students--normally",146.40000000000001,615.41489999999999,347.02800000000002,627.81690000000003,9,false],["at a conference.",146.40000000000001,628.41090000000008,206.06100000000004,640.81290000000001,9,false],["Because movements are built around continually",370.20299999999997,563.35389999999961,555.88200000000006,575.75589999999954,9,false],["reaching the Freshman class and assimilating these",370.20299999999997,576.34989999999948,565.78200000000004,588.75189999999952,9,false],["first year students, we must be very intentional about",370.20299999999997,589.34589999999957,571.14600000000007,601.74789999999962,9,false],["targeting and assimilating Freshmen.",370.20299999999997,602.34189999999955,512.15099999999995,614.7438999999996,9,false],["FIRST QUARTER",146.40000000000001,660.81989999999996,216.22000000000003,681.35990000000004,20,false],["Each Quarter has a distinct emphasis and goal.",146.40000000000001,680.43489999999997,323.33100000000002,692.83690000000001,9,false],["The Emphasis of the First Quarter is CONTACT--",146.40000000000001,693.43089999999995,336.01200000000006,705.8329,9,false],["exposure and evangelism--gathering as many bodies",146.40000000000001,706.42689999999993,344.51700000000005,718.82889999999998,9,false],["By scheduling your open, large group (even co-",370.20299999999997,628.34289999999964,546.15300000000002,640.74489999999957,9,false],["ed) Bible Studies before the year begins, you have",370.20299999999997,641.33889999999951,556.25099999999998,653.74089999999956,9,false],["something to invite the students to as soon as you",370.20299999999997,654.33489999999961,557.05200000000013,666.73689999999954,9,false],["meet them. The advantage is that you don’t have to",370.20299999999997,667.33089999999959,561.30900000000008,679.73289999999952,9,false],["wait until you get all of their schedules and find a",370.20299999999997,680.32689999999957,554.50500000000011,692.72889999999961,9,false],["common time before you begin. If a student can’t",370.20299999999997,693.32289999999955,554.48700000000008,705.72489999999959,9,false],["come to your study, you can give him or her the time",370.20299999999997,706.31889999999953,566.03400000000011,718.72089999999957,9,false],["© 2010, CruPress, All Rights Reserved. CruPress.com",204.23800660000001,766.03521969999997,407.76200660000006,778.43721970000001,9,false]],"h":792,"ocr":false,"w":612},{"h":792,"w":612,"ocr":false,"segs":[["of another study. This open Bible study also frees up",146.40000000000001,33.434899999999857,343.05000000000007,45.836899999999901,9,false],["your leadership students to meet other students and",146.40000000000001,46.430899999999838,343.86900000000009,58.832899999999881,9,false],["share their faith rather than preparing for Bible Study.",146.40000000000001,59.426899999999819,351.34800000000001,71.828899999999862,9,false],["A major objective of the First Quarter is recruiting",146.40000000000001,85.427899999999795,337.31700000000012,97.829899999999839,9,false],["for the Fall Conference. The objective for each of",146.40000000000001,98.423899999999776,330.75600000000009,110.82589999999982,9,false],["our conferences differs. The Fall Conference is",146.40000000000001,111.41989999999976,323.3850000000001,123.8218999999998,9,false],["usually by State. It’s at this time where students",146.40000000000001,124.41589999999974,327.01200000000011,136.81789999999978,9,false],["begin to get a picture of what Campus Crusade is and",146.40000000000001,137.41189999999972,346.22700000000009,149.81389999999976,9,false],["an introduction to the Christmas Conference and",146.40000000000001,150.4078999999997,333.36600000000004,162.80989999999974,9,false],["projects. This is where we “run the flag up” regarding",146.40000000000001,163.40389999999968,346.45200000000011,175.80589999999972,9,false],["who we are as a movement and some of the things we",146.40000000000001,176.39989999999966,346.5870000000001,188.8018999999997,9,false],["are committed to. This is why we usually have a staff",146.40000000000001,189.39589999999964,344.1930000000001,201.79789999999969,9,false],["person as our conference speaker. On the positive",146.40000000000001,202.39189999999962,333.93300000000011,214.79389999999967,9,false],["side, this is where many students say to themselves",146.40000000000001,215.3878999999996,340.161,227.78989999999965,9,false],["or to the Lord, “This is what I want to be involved in.”",146.40000000000001,228.38389999999958,346.36200000000008,240.78589999999963,9,false],["On the other hand, some students will conclude that",146.40000000000001,241.37989999999957,343.62600000000009,253.78189999999961,9,false],["Crusade isn’t for them.",146.40000000000001,254.37589999999955,233.05200000000002,266.77789999999959,9,false],["momentum outreach of some type that will stretch",370.20299999999997,33.399899999999889,562.39800000000014,45.801899999999932,9,false],["the faith of your students during the Third Quarter.",370.20299999999997,46.39589999999987,563.82899999999995,58.797899999999913,9,false],["Classics, Team Meeting Emphasis Weeks, a large",370.20299999999997,59.39189999999985,555.88200000000006,71.793899999999894,9,false],["College Life, etc. are excellent ways to make it easy",370.20299999999997,72.387899999999831,561.40800000000013,84.789899999999875,9,false],["for your average student to have a ministry when he",370.20299999999997,85.383899999999812,565.4670000000001,97.785899999999856,9,false],["returns. Your job is to give your students avenues to",370.20299999999997,98.379899999999793,564.75600000000009,110.78189999999984,9,false],["express their faith. Schedule events that they can",370.20299999999997,111.37589999999977,555.71100000000001,123.77789999999982,9,false],["invite their non-Christian friends to. It is during",370.20299999999997,124.37189999999975,553.0920000000001,136.7738999999998,9,false],["the Third Quarter that you challenge your students",370.20299999999997,137.36789999999974,563.25300000000004,149.76989999999978,9,false],["to move into or remain in the dorms. Together, you",370.20299999999997,150.36389999999972,561.01200000000006,162.76589999999976,9,false],["are looking forward do your Spring Retreat. The",370.20299999999997,163.3598999999997,551.51700000000005,175.76189999999974,9,false],["Spring Conference is usually held by campus and the",370.20299999999997,176.35589999999968,569.72400000000016,188.75789999999972,9,false],["emphasis is on outreach. For many campuses, it is the",370.20299999999997,189.35189999999966,572.97300000000007,201.7538999999997,9,false],["time to be involved in another country of the world.",370.20299999999997,202.34789999999964,564.02700000000004,214.74989999999968,9,false],["Opening a new campus ministry in Juárez, showing",370.20299999999997,215.34389999999962,565.44000000000005,227.74589999999966,9,false],["the JESUS film in Mazatlan, or sharing your faith on a",370.20299999999997,228.3398999999996,574.38600000000008,240.74189999999965,9,false],["ski lift are all ways that can galvanize the faith of your",370.20299999999997,241.33589999999958,572.35200000000009,253.73789999999963,9,false],["students. You probably want to schedule your best and",370.20299999999997,254.33189999999956,575.39400000000001,266.73389999999961,9,false],["most creative social events during this Quarter since",370.20299999999997,267.32789999999954,569.71500000000003,279.72989999999959,9,false],["momentum can wane.",370.20299999999997,280.32389999999964,454.09199999999998,292.72589999999963,9,false],["THE SECOND QUARTER",146.40000000000001,286.81989999999996,247.18000000000001,307.35989999999998,20,false],["The emphasis of the Second Quarter is probably on",146.40000000000001,306.43489999999997,339.8370000000001,318.83689999999996,9,false],["CONSOLIDATING the fruit of the First Quarter",146.40000000000001,319.43089999999995,329.69400000000007,331.83289999999994,9,false],["and going after the friends of those who got involved",146.40000000000001,332.42689999999993,343.74300000000005,344.82889999999992,9,false],["the First Quarter. This paves the way for training",146.40000000000001,345.42289999999991,331.44000000000017,357.8248999999999,9,false],["opportunities. We make certain that all of the Fall",146.40000000000001,358.41889999999989,334.24800000000005,370.82089999999988,9,false],["Conference students are in groups and group leaders",146.40000000000001,371.41489999999988,345.71400000000006,383.81689999999986,9,false],["are trained in exactly what to do. Large group Bible",146.40000000000001,384.41089999999986,338.2890000000001,396.81289999999984,9,false],["studies can be replaced or augmented with small",146.40000000000001,397.40689999999984,330.36900000000003,409.80889999999982,9,false],["groups and Action Groups. Momentum is built as we",146.40000000000001,410.40289999999982,344.92200000000003,422.8048999999998,9,false],["look forward to the Christmas Conference.",146.40000000000001,423.3988999999998,308.33700000000005,435.80089999999979,9,false],["THE FOURTH QUARTER",370.20000000000005,312.81989999999996,470.20000000000005,333.35989999999998,20,false],["The goal of the fourth quarter is CONTINUATION-",370.20000000000005,332.43489999999997,565.95900000000006,344.83689999999996,9,false],["-preparing the students for the summer. This is the",370.20000000000005,345.43089999999995,563.19600000000014,357.83289999999994,9,false],["shortest of all quarters (normally only 4-5 weeks) but",370.20000000000005,358.42689999999993,571.74600000000009,370.82889999999992,9,false],["an important one. Planning for the impending school",370.20000000000005,371.42289999999991,570.39600000000019,383.8248999999999,9,false],["year, room scheduling, etc. must be done before you",370.20000000000005,384.41889999999989,564.42000000000007,396.82089999999988,9,false],["and your team leave for the summer. After Spring",370.20000000000005,397.41489999999988,558.20100000000014,409.81689999999986,9,false],["Break is not the best time to be setting major goals.",370.20000000000005,410.41089999999986,561.66600000000017,422.81289999999984,9,false],["Your momentum activities are finished for the year.",370.20000000000005,423.40689999999984,564.97800000000007,435.80889999999982,9,false],["The Christmas Conference is comprised of students",146.40000000000001,449.39989999999977,344.08500000000004,461.80189999999976,9,false],["from several states and it is the largest conference of",146.40000000000001,462.39589999999976,344.92200000000003,474.79789999999974,9,false],["the year. Many students are impressed by the number",146.40000000000001,475.39189999999974,348.82800000000009,487.79389999999972,9,false],["of Christian students present. The emphasis is always",146.40000000000001,488.38789999999972,350.67300000000012,500.7898999999997,9,false],["on going to the world. An overwhelming majority",146.40000000000001,501.3838999999997,331.62900000000013,513.78589999999963,9,false],["of the students who go on projects and missions or",146.40000000000001,514.37989999999968,337.00200000000007,526.78189999999972,9,false],["develop into your leaders will be at this conference.",146.40000000000001,527.37589999999966,340.17900000000009,539.7778999999997,9,false],["C YC L E S",43.841199999999994,621.26440000000002,57.071199999999997,649.97140000000002,7,false],["O F",43.841199999999994,607.93640000000005,57.071200000000005,618.2894,7,false],["C A M P U S",43.841200000000001,573.48239999999998,57.071200000000005,604.96140000000003,7,false],["M O M E N T U M 2",43.841200000000001,509.49990000000003,57.071200000000005,570.50739999999996,9,false],["PLANNING",370.20000000000005,455.81989999999996,416.58000000000004,476.35989999999998,20,false],["Planning is simplified by using the Quarter System.",370.20000000000005,475.43489999999997,564.27600000000007,487.83689999999996,9,false],["Using yearly planning goals and objectives does",370.20000000000005,488.43089999999995,550.03800000000001,500.83289999999994,9,false],["not serve the average team leader or Campus",370.20000000000005,501.42689999999993,539.41800000000012,513.82889999999998,9,false],["Ministry because it is so difficult to measure real",370.20000000000005,514.42289999999991,554.07000000000005,526.82489999999984,9,false],["progress toward the goal. For example, again if your",370.20000000000005,527.41889999999989,564.51900000000023,539.82089999999994,9,false],["evangelistic goal for the year is to in some way shape",370.20000000000005,540.41489999999999,568.12800000000016,552.81689999999992,9,false],["or form initiate with 1,000 students, anything you",370.20000000000005,553.41089999999986,557.79600000000005,565.8128999999999,9,false],["do in one of the 24 weeks on campus doesn’t seem to",370.20000000000005,566.40689999999995,567.71399999999994,578.80889999999999,9,false],["amount to much, either positively or negatively. If I",370.20000000000005,579.40289999999993,563.55600000000015,591.80489999999998,9,false],["don’t do any evangelism, I can always say, “Well, I have",370.20000000000005,592.39889999999991,575.98500000000013,604.80089999999996,9,false],["22 more weeks to make up for it.”",370.20000000000005,605.39490000000001,495.57900000000006,617.79689999999994,9,false],["THE THIRD QUARTER",146.40000000000001,572.81989999999996,237.86000000000001,593.35989999999993,20,false],["The goal of the Third Quarter is to CAPITALIZE",146.40000000000001,592.43489999999997,330.04500000000007,604.83690000000001,9,false],["on the momentum of the commitments made at the",146.40000000000001,605.43090000000007,340.80900000000008,617.8329,9,false],["Christmas Conference. At Christmas Conference",146.40000000000001,618.42689999999993,333.2940000000001,630.82889999999998,9,false],["your students will be challenged to reach their",146.40000000000001,631.42290000000003,321.35100000000011,643.82490000000007,9,false],["campuses for Christ and take the gospel to the",146.40000000000001,644.41890000000001,320.48700000000008,656.82090000000005,9,false],["world. By faith, many of them have made fresh",146.40000000000001,657.41489999999999,321.12600000000009,669.81690000000003,9,false],["commitments to the Lord and are ready to be",146.40000000000001,670.41089999999997,316.26600000000008,682.81290000000001,9,false],["challenged. You cannot return from the Christmas",146.40000000000001,683.40689999999995,336.74100000000004,695.80889999999999,9,false],["Conference with a “business as usual” attitude. For",146.40000000000001,696.40290000000005,339.57600000000002,708.80489999999998,9,false],["this reason, it is usually a good idea to plan a high",146.40000000000001,709.39890000000003,331.21500000000015,721.80089999999996,9,false],["The Quarter System is different. Because each",370.20000000000005,631.39589999999998,545.27700000000004,643.79790000000003,9,false],["Quarter is only 5-7 weeks long, each of those weeks is",370.20000000000005,644.39189999999996,571.44000000000005,656.79390000000001,9,false],["important in the accomplishment of your goals. You,",370.20000000000005,657.38789999999995,567.99300000000005,669.78989999999999,9,false],["as the team leader can set weekly goals and emphasis",370.20000000000005,670.38389999999993,570.78300000000013,682.78589999999997,9,false],["to move you toward the accomplishment of your",370.20000000000005,683.37989999999991,552.45000000000016,695.78189999999995,9,false],["vision. To accomplish your yearly goals you work",370.20000000000005,696.3759,555.20400000000018,708.77789999999993,9,false],["toward accomplishing your Quarterly goals. You work",370.20000000000005,709.37189999999998,573.54600000000005,721.77389999999991,9,false],["© 2010, CruPress, All Rights Reserved. CruPress.com",204.23800660000001,766.03521969999997,407.76200660000006,778.43721970000001,9,false]]},{"segs":[["toward accomplishing your Quarterly goals by setting",146.40000000000001,33.434899999999857,349.1160000000001,45.836899999999901,9,false],["and working on your weekly goals. This contributes",146.40000000000001,46.430899999999838,341.16000000000014,58.832899999999881,9,false],["to you taking an active role in leading your team. You",146.40000000000001,59.426899999999819,345.18300000000011,71.828899999999862,9,false],["need to know when to have an evangelistic push and",146.40000000000001,72.4228999999998,343.1400000000001,84.824899999999843,9,false],["when you need to take a break. You set the pace for",146.40000000000001,85.41889999999978,337.01100000000019,97.820899999999824,9,false],["each Quarter by communicating with your teamwhat",146.40000000000001,98.414899999999761,347.41500000000008,110.81689999999981,9,false],["needs to be done this week.",146.40000000000001,111.41089999999974,248.99100000000004,123.81289999999979,9,false],["When the Quarter ends, so do your goals. Whether",146.40000000000001,137.41189999999972,336.29100000000011,149.81389999999976,9,false],["you reached them or not, there is no carry-over in",146.40000000000001,150.4078999999997,333.02400000000011,162.80989999999974,9,false],["your numerical goals. Mail a campus brochure and",146.40000000000001,163.40389999999968,337.20000000000016,175.80589999999972,9,false],["calendar to each uncontacted student along with an",146.40000000000001,176.39989999999966,341.71800000000007,188.8018999999997,9,false],["invitation to your weekly meeting. You learn from",146.40000000000001,189.39589999999964,334.28400000000011,201.79789999999969,9,false],["your mistakes and begin anew by setting new goals for",146.40000000000001,202.39189999999962,351.02400000000011,214.79389999999967,9,false],["the impending Quarter.",146.40000000000001,215.3878999999996,235.23000000000002,227.78989999999965,9,false],["EVALUATING AND REPORTING",146.40000000000001,247.81989999999996,276.24000000000001,268.35989999999993,20,false],["Each week at staff meeting you need to be asking",146.40000000000001,267.43489999999986,330.09000000000003,279.8368999999999,9,false],["“What did you do?” and “How did it go?” We are",146.40000000000001,280.43089999999995,325.57200000000012,292.83289999999994,9,false],["looking for responses that reflect our values of faith,",146.40000000000001,293.42689999999993,342.99600000000004,305.82889999999992,9,false],["effectiveness and development.",146.40000000000001,306.42289999999991,265.56900000000002,318.8248999999999,9,false],["If you still are not getting the results you want, you",146.40000000000001,332.42389999999989,337.20000000000005,344.82589999999988,9,false],["need to evaluate if you are doing the right thing.",146.40000000000001,345.41989999999987,325.72500000000014,357.82189999999986,9,false],["What you evaluate is what you are accomplishing",146.40000000000001,358.41589999999985,333.0150000000001,370.81789999999984,9,false],["together as a movement--the sum total of individual",146.40000000000001,371.41189999999983,343.23900000000003,383.81389999999982,9,false],["effort and activity. Whose lives are we corporately",146.40000000000001,384.40789999999981,335.29200000000014,396.8098999999998,9,false],["reaching and changing? This means you’ve got to",146.40000000000001,397.40389999999979,331.34100000000007,409.80589999999978,9,false],["work together to accomplish your goals.",146.40000000000001,410.39989999999977,297.01500000000004,422.80189999999976,9,false],["At the conclusion of each Quarter is a time for",146.40000000000001,436.40089999999975,320.09100000000007,448.80289999999974,9,false],["evaluation and planning. This time gives you a little",146.40000000000001,449.39689999999973,341.09700000000004,461.79889999999972,9,false],["breathing room and time to honestly evaluate and",146.40000000000001,462.39289999999971,334.23000000000008,474.7948999999997,9,false],["plan before diving into another busy week. Because",146.40000000000001,475.38889999999969,339.97199999999998,487.79089999999968,9,false],["plans are only as good as the information they are",146.40000000000001,488.38489999999967,333.0870000000001,500.78689999999966,9,false],["based on, you are in a much better position to plan the",146.40000000000001,501.38089999999966,349.53900000000016,513.7828999999997,9,false],["specifics of the Second Quarter after the conclusion of",146.40000000000001,514.37689999999964,351.66300000000007,526.77889999999957,9,false],["the First Quarter.",146.40000000000001,527.37289999999962,212.73899999999998,539.77489999999966,9,false],["C YC L E S",43.841199999999994,621.18340000000001,57.071199999999997,649.8904,7,false],["O F",43.841199999999994,607.85540000000003,57.071200000000005,618.20839999999998,7,false],["C A M P U S",43.841200000000001,573.40139999999997,57.071200000000005,604.88040000000001,7,false],["M O M E N T U M 3",43.841200000000001,509.49989999999997,57.071200000000005,570.42640000000006,9,false],["See the chart on the next page for a helpful",146.40000000000001,566.18089999999961,317.31899999999996,579.16789999999958,9,false],["overview of the cycles . . .",146.40000000000001,579.17689999999959,246.90300000000002,592.16389999999956,9,false],["© 2010, CruPress, All Rights Reserved. CruPress.com",204.23800660000001,766.03521969999997,407.76200660000006,778.43721970000001,9,false]],"ocr":false,"w":612,"h":792},{"w":612,"ocr":false,"segs":[["Focus(es)",41.280000000000001,382.21199999999993,89.277600000000007,393.17999999999995,12,true],["Try some",31.32,483.21599999999995,91.321599999999989,497.67999999999995,16,true],["of this",41.048000000000002,502.41599999999994,81.484800000000007,516.87999999999988,16,true],["stuff.",44.408000000000001,521.61599999999999,78.140000000000015,536.07999999999993,16,true],["The six columns",27.960000000000001,552.21000000000004,94.686000000000007,561.25,10,true],["to the right show",27.240000000000002,564.21000000000004,95.520999999999987,573.25,10,true],["some ideas and",29.880000000000003,576.21000000000004,92.879000000000019,585.25,10,true],["activities you",34.68,588.21000000000004,87.960000000000008,597.25,10,true],["can use dur